{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A set of sequences kept in a radix tree (Morrison, 1968): a trie in which every chain of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices with one child and no key is merged into one edge labelled with all its symbols."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/PrefixView"],"title":"Structures","generated":true,"anchor":"Structures"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/init()","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/init(_:)"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/count","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/isEmpty"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/contains(_:)-39nls","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/elements(withPrefix:)","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/hasPrefix(_:)","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/insert(_:)-3ywij","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/longestPrefix(of:)","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/remove(_:)-3svqg"],"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/Decodable-Implementations","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/Encodable-Implementations","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/Equatable-Implementations","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/Tries\/RadixTree\/ExpressibleByArrayLiteral-Implementations","doc:\/\/Tries\/documentation\/T